{"id":"631688","name":"大黄米三色藜麦鸡肉粽子","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/631688/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大黄米","amount":"750克"},{"name":"三色藜麦","amount":"250克"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"粽叶子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红绳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用碱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好一块鸡胸肉，清洗干净。","img":"images/631688/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成小块。","img":"images/631688/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加盐、鸡精、蚝油、生抽、老抽、料酒、五香粉、胡椒粉，搅拌均匀，腌2个小时。","img":"images/631688/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备好三色藜麦。","img":"images/631688/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"提前泡发2个小时。","img":"images/631688/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备好大黄米，清洗干净。","img":"images/631688/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"三色藜麦沥干水分和大黄米。","img":"images/631688/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/631688/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加盐和食用碱(一丢丢)，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/631688/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"准备包粽子了。","img":"images/631688/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"粽叶子清洗干净，修掉两头的边边。","img":"images/631688/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取两片粽叶，首位重叠。","img":"images/631688/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"叠出一个漏斗形状。","img":"images/631688/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"底部加米。","img":"images/631688/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入腌好的鸡肉。","img":"images/631688/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再盖上米，稍按一下，压平。","img":"images/631688/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"把上面的粽叶盖下来，再折叠一下。","img":"images/631688/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"用绳子扎紧。","img":"images/631688/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"修掉多余的边边。","img":"images/631688/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"依次全部包完。","img":"images/631688/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放入电压力锅，压3个小时。","img":"images/631688/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/631688/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/631688/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631688/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"尝尝哦，换种口味吃粽子也不错。","img":"images/631688/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}